WEBVTT

NOTE Micro-scene B "Hallway". Fair Standard track authored to the Netflix English TTSG.
NOTE [unknown voice] is used for the off-screen speaker because the identity is concealed.

c001
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.900
Did you order something?

c002
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.200
No. Why?

c003
00:00:03.387 --> 00:00:05.720
[unknown voice] Can someone get the door?

c004
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.800
Who is that?

c005
00:00:06.953 --> 00:00:08.620
I thought everyone was out.

c006
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.220
[unknown voice] My hands are full.
Hurry up.

c007
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.920
-I'll go.
-I've got it.

c008
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.200
[glass shatters]

c009
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.300
Oh, no.

c010
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.300
That was the olive oil.

c011
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.220
Amara? When did you get back?

c012
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.967
About a minute
before you two stopped arguing.

c013
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.300
Nobody was arguing.
